A.NX=new B.cF("anxiety","Anxiety / scanxiety","\u0642\u0644\u0642","\ud83d\udc9c","Scanxiety is normal and valid. Mindfulness, talking to someone who understands, and limiting scan-related searches can help.")
A.uh=new B.cF("sleep","Sleep quality","\u062c\u0648\u062f\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0646\u0648\u0645","\ud83d\ude34","Consistent sleep schedule and avoiding screens before bed helps. Anxiety and hot flashes often disturb sleep.")
A.uc=new B.cF("mood","Mood / depression","\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0632\u0627\u062c","\ud83d\udc99","Post-treatment emotional challenges are common and valid. Support groups, therapy, and talking to survivors all help.")
A.ug=new B.cF("fatigue","Fatigue","\u0625\u0631\u0647\u0627\u0642","\ud83c\udf19","Post-treatment fatigue can last months. Gentle daily movement and good sleep hygiene help more than rest alone.")
